            "space_id": "semeval-glm-flash-r2-b10",
            "text": "His paper narrated the discovery chronologically.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T12:44:51.798763+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-glm-flash-r2-b10-semeval-9082",
            "_key": "semeval-glm-flash-r2-b10-semeval-9082",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-9082",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:8a611ee21d4187b71cd488f4150c94747ee02bca3a5ee55e279b1fb248f634ee",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T12:44:51.798767+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-glm-flash-r2-b10",
            "text": "They were not issued guns at the time, but the office did have one handgun that was locked in a safe; however, there was no ammunition.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T12:44:51.798767+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-glm-flash-r2-b10-semeval-9133",
            "_key": "semeval-glm-flash-r2-b10-semeval-9133",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-9133",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:a8e4b12955f330b611dcea1e915321d5688efa26ca15853ccca6773dc6aa3874",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T12:44:51.798772+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-glm-flash-r2-b10",
            "text": "A user activates the device with the power-on button.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T12:44:51.798772+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-glm-flash-r2-b10-semeval-9198",
            "_key": "semeval-glm-flash-r2-b10-semeval-9198",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-9198",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:ad4664506f23fac6c62fc270fc50e14d4c6ac4ddb1a8113cdb7f774e5083d5e9",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T12:44:51.798777+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-glm-flash-r2-b10",
            "text": "Yes, I have a mutation of thrushes eating me out of bird food.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T12:44:51.798777+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-glm-flash-r2-b10-semeval-9323",
            "_key": "semeval-glm-flash-r2-b10-semeval-9323",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-9323",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:9223fd53d396f1a967221fe8a93f6add51d571629fdf74e0412ebe402a67b70f",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T12:44:51.798781+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-glm-flash-r2-b10",
            "text": "The only light was from two turrets of bulletproof glass.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T12:44:51.798781+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-glm-flash-r2-b10-semeval-9367",
            "_key": "semeval-glm-flash-r2-b10-semeval-9367",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-9367",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:62d31da8254a719944c5489e275b3f8776343f60dc84470dd34b0bf784b3c5f1",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T12:44:51.798785+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-glm-flash-r2-b10",
            "text": "In its last 12 meetings this year the committee has made about 30-35 recommendations.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T12:44:51.798785+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-glm-flash-r2-b10-semeval-9396",
            "_key": "semeval-glm-flash-r2-b10-semeval-9396",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-9396",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:5be1ccf4fadff1ec59d8ae6fd11eb68c69a7404b4ec07d4970742181a3ed2ac4",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T12:44:51.798789+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-glm-flash-r2-b10",
            "text": "Since Sally Industries' inception, John Wood has been a key member of the company's management team and a founding member of the board of directors.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T12:44:51.798789+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-glm-flash-r2-b10-semeval-9485",
            "_key": "semeval-glm-flash-r2-b10-semeval-9485",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-9485",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:25a666016b863e7f5172001c7059b33884d946300e7ae53a3726af34be9f7b7f",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T12:44:51.798790+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-glm-flash-r2-b10",
            "text": "The water rushing off that safe platform started to wash the seal back into the sea, but then the humpback gave the seal a gentle nudge with its flipper.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T12:44:51.798790+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-glm-flash-r2-b10-semeval-9491",
            "_key": "semeval-glm-flash-r2-b10-semeval-9491",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-9491",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:d0242067dc64f64f16d7d42c909a9ed995c5a04c61ccf2a6b3322a8651f40e7e",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T12:44:51.798798+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-glm-flash-r2-b10",
            "text": "The folks at the Lilly Endowment were interested in the study of philanthropy through a biographical lens.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T12:44:51.798798+00:00"
          }
